'''Voli''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 6.9 Update|Version 6.9]] obtainable via the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES (Gacha Event)|ELEMENTAL PIXIES]] gacha event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]] increases health, attack power and gains extra [[Freeze|freeze]] time. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 15.7 Update|Version 15.7]] further increases health and attack power, marginally shortens attack frequency and backswing, and grants [[Multi-Hit]], [[Long Distance]] and [[Immune to Drain|Drain Immunity]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].

