==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.7 Update|Version 15.7]], the Freeze ability wasn't capitalized in its first two Forms' descriptions while "vs." lacked the abbreviating period in the second and third.
*Volta's name references a famous scientist who studied electricity [[wikipedia:Alessandro Volta|Alessandro Volta]], after whom the unit of electricity "Volt" is named after.
*Volta's Japanese name, 天雷の精霊''ピカ''ボルト (Tenrai no Seirei ''Pika''volt), references the term "Pika" which means light or electricity in the Japanese language.
*A gigavolt is a billion Volts, referencing the True Form being more powerful than before.
**A teravolt is a trillion Volts, referencing their Ultra Form being their most powerful form.
*Voli is the only Pixie whose Evolved Form moves faster than its Normal Form.

